                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.24/104: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Guatemala</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-12-06T21:00:00-05:00">December 6, 1940—9
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>103. Your 117, November 27, 9 a.m. The War Department has informed this
                    Department that the Commanding General Panama Canal Zone has been directed to
                    send an officer to Guatemala City to survey the requirements and to submit
                    recommendations to the War Department. This Department is to be informed when
                    the report has been received.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
